1 1 1 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 754 Tm (3. Deep Technical Rationale: Why RAG Beats Fine-Tuning) Tj ET
0.01 0.52 0.78 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 720 Tm (A. Real-Time Zero-Day Adaptability vs. Static Training Cutoffs) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 704 Tm (Threat intelligence is an inherently dynamic domain. Public vulnerability repositories \(NVD, GHSA, CISA-KEV\) publish) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 691.5 Tm (over 100 new CVEs and exploit proofs-of-concept every single day. Fine-tuned or custom-trained models suffer from) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 679.0 Tm (immediate knowledge staleness because their knowledge base is strictly locked at their last training epoch. Retraining a) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 666.5 Tm (model daily or weekly to incorporate new CVEs requires continuous GPU compute pipelines, dataset curation, and regression) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 654.0 Tm (testing - making it operationally infeasible.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 635.25 Tm (CENTRIX RAG decouples knowledge storage from reasoning logic. When a new CVE or Exploit-DB entry is ingested into) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 622.75 Tm (ChromaDB \(via background feed sync or ingest_exploits.py\), it is instantly searchable by the RAG engine within seconds.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 610.25 Tm (The underlying LLM \(qwen2.5-coder\) does not need to be retrained or modified to reason over brand new vulnerabilities.) Tj ET
0.01 0.52 0.78 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 589 Tm (B. Prevention of Catastrophic Forgetting & Format Instability) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 573 Tm (Fine-tuning a general-purpose coding LLM on security text datasets triggers 'catastrophic forgetting' - a phenomenon) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 560.5 Tm (where the model's weight adjustments for vulnerability data degrade its general reasoning capabilities. Specifically,) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 548.0 Tm (fine-tuned security models frequently lose the ability to parse complex multi-language source code syntax \(Python, JS,) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 535.5 Tm (Java\) and fail to output strict JSON schemas required by automated security reporting pipelines.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 516.75 Tm (CENTRIX RAG preserves 100% of the base LLM's coding and instruction-following performance. The model receives raw) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 504.25 Tm (unmodified source code alongside verbatim retrieved context chunks in the prompt, allowing it to apply pure reasoning) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 491.75 Tm (without distorting its internal representations.) Tj ET
0.01 0.52 0.78 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 458 Tm (C. Elimination of Dangerous LLM Hallucinations in Audit Reports) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 442 Tm (In automated vulnerability assessments \(VAPT\), hallucinating a non-existent CVE ID or generating invalid exploit syntax) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 429.5 Tm (destroys report credibility and wastes hundreds of engineering hours on false positives. Fine-tuned models predict text) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 417.0 Tm (statistically, making them highly prone to inventing realistic-sounding but fake CVE numbers \(e.g. 'CVE-2025-99999'\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 398.25 Tm (CENTRIX RAG eliminates hallucination risks through a two-tier verification mechanism:
1. Grounded Context Prompting: The) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 385.75 Tm (LLM is strictly constrained to cite only CVEs present in the retrieved ChromaDB context.
2. Automated Hallucination) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 373.25 Tm (Detector: scanner/report_generator.py inspects LLM citations against retrieved advisories. If the model cites an uncited) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.33 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 360.75 Tm (CVE, CENTRIX injects a prominent '[WARNING] Potential LLM Hallucination' banner in the final report.) Tj ET
